# gnome-keyring (via `secret-tool`); `pwd-copy` copies it to the clipboard (wl-copy) and
# clears the clipboard after a timeout. No file is written; the keyring is per-machine.
#
# Example CLI Commands:
#   1. Store (hidden prompt, asked twice):   uv run .os/cli.py pwd-store
#   2. Copy to clipboard (clears after 5s):  uv run .os/cli.py pwd-copy
